SUMMARY:The Moth StorySLAM
LOCATION:The Bell House\, Carroll Gardens-Cobble Hill-Gowanus-Red Hook
DESCRIPTION:StorySLAM NYC-CARETAKERS. Prepare a 5-minute story about those 
 
who go the extra mile. Selfless moms & dutiful dads\, family members who ca
 
re for the young & old 24/7 or strangers & loved ones who step up in a pinc
 
h. Love\, duty\, blood\, sweat & tears. The acts of service or obligation t
 
hat are often invisible to everyone except those on the receiving end. The 
 
labor of care that is unpaid but priceless. The playlist that got you throu
 
gh a rough patch\, the post-op meal train that kept you nourished. Did some
 
one save the day w/ tough love or a couch to crash on? Who did you nurse th
 
rough a rough patch? We all need someone we can lean on. Door Time: 6:30pm 
 
(front bar opens: 5:30pm). Show Time: 7:30pm. 21 & over w/ valid\, governme
 
nt-issued photo ID. *General Admission standing & seating. Seating 1st come
 
 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selection. *No outside 
 
food/drink. **If you have an accessibility request\, please email thebellho
 
use@livenation.com. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-moth-s
 
toryslam-brooklyn-new-york-10-26-2026/event/300064BB0C5CDEDB
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-moth-storyslam-brooklyn-new-york-10-26
 
-2026/event/300064BB0C5CDEDB
END:VEVENT
