DESCRIPTION:VIP experience includes: meet and greet and champagne TCB prese
 
nts: CODE RED Code Red: Industry Night Weekly on Monday Doors 7:30pm Guest 
 
Opening Act 8pm Main Show featuring The Cabaret Burlesque 8:30 - 10:30pm Mu
 
sic and Bar until 1am Contact @thecabaretburlesque on instagram to APPLY to
 
 perform as an Opening Act An Industry Night where your wildest fantasies j
 
ust might come true. Welcome to CODE RED---an electrifying world where Pari
 
sian cabaret meets Amsterdam's edge\, Moscow's mystique\, and the unapologe
 
tic glamour of Studio 54. Fashion is as much a part of the performance as t
 
he artists themselves\, with striking couture\, bold silhouettes\, and runw
 
ay-worthy style setting the scene for an unforgettable night. Expect dazzli
 
ng performances\, intoxicating music\, provocative artistry\, and immersive
 
 moments that blur the line between audience and spectacle. Inspired by the
 
 golden age of nightlife\, where icons\, artists\, and dreamers came to see
 
 and be seen\, CODE RED celebrates fearless self-expression\, decadent ente
 
rtainment\, and the thrill of the unexpected. Dress boldly. Stay curious. B
 
ring your calling card. Welcome to the show where fantasy\, fashion\, and n
 
ightlife collide. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-cabar
 
et-burlesque-presents-code-berlin-tickets/14285484
